      "name": "JF Content With Icon Box (No Icon))",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "A Heritage of Custom Wedding Dresses Melbourne",
        "heading": "Three Generations of the Needle: Designed for Your Legacy",
        "intro": "",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_22925.png",
        "content": "<p>At Julie Sufi, the art of the gown is a language passed down through a heritage of sartorial mastery. We are not a brand built on fleeting trends, but a lineage built on the mastery of the stitch. </p><p>When you enter our Melbourne atelier, you bypass the noise of the showroom for a Direct-to-Designer dialogue. You are sitting with the person behind the scissors—the artisan who translates your vision into a structural, breathtaking reality.</p><p>While the industry scales for the masses, we focus on the individual, ensuring your bespoke wedding dress is an heirloom-quality garment designed for your specific geometry and your unique legacy.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "background_color": "#ffffff",
        "text_color": "#232128",
        "button_background_color": "#1f1f23",
        "button_text_color": "#ffffff",
