            "heading": "The Pillars of a Julie Sufi Original",
            "feature_1_heading": "Invisible Support",
            "feature_1_text": "<p>Built-in couture corsetry is hand-sculpted to your frame, offering a flawless contour without the need for additional undergarments.</p>",
            "feature_2_heading": "Structural Precision",
