        "heading": "The Engineering of Grace: Infinite Customisation",
        "intro": "<p>The secret to flawless custom wedding dresses lies beneath the silk. More than an aesthetic choice, it is a feat of sartorial engineering. We view dressmaking not merely as sewing, but as a form of soft architecture-where the physics of weight distribution meets the fluid movement of the body.</p>",
