      "type": "jf-coustom-dress-picker",
      "blocks": {
        "dress_type_WQ4BqP": {
          "type": "dress_type",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_22936.png",
            "heading": "The Visionary",
            "subheading": "<p><strong>For the bride who seeks a singular aesthetic.</strong></p>",
            "text": "<p>If you find the standard bridal offering repetitive, you are likely looking for a designer to translate a specific aesthetic soul into a physical reality. You value the creative dialogue of the process and refuse to settle for a design that already exists. For you, the bespoke wedding gown is a canvas for an original story.</p>"
          }
        },
        "dress_type_8kiCKV": {
          "type": "dress_type",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_22937.png",
            "heading": "The Perfectionist",
            "subheading": "<p><strong>For the bride who prioritises the mathematics of fit.</strong></p>",
            "text": "<p>You understand that true elegance is a derivative of architecture. If you have struggled with standard sizing or simply demand a garment that moves in total harmony with your skin, you seek the security of our Toile prototype dress. You require a gown sculpted for your specific geometry to ensure effortless poise.</p>"
          }
        },
        "dress_type_rpkbCV": {
          "type": "dress_type",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_22938.png",
            "heading": "The Heritage-Seeker",
            "subheading": "<p><strong>For the bride who views her gown as a landmark.</strong></p>",
            "text": "<p>You see a wedding gown as a piece of your family history rather than a single-day garment. Drawn to Julie Sufi's three generations of lineage, you value the heritage techniques and master-craftsmanship that ensure your handmade wedding dress remains a preserved masterpiece for decades to come.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "dress_type_WQ4BqP",
