      "name": "JF Coustom Dress Picker",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "DEFINING THE JULIE SUFI BRIDE",
        "heading": "Is a Custom Wedding Dress Right for You?",
        "intro": "<p>A departure from the traditional, a couture commission is an investment in both time and self-expression. A Julie Sufi gown is not found-it is forged. While every bride is unique, those who enter our atelier are typically driven by one of three distinct motivations.</p>",
        "footer_heading": "The Julie Sufi Distinction",
        "footer_text": "<p>Whether you are driven by vision, fit, or legacy, the result is a singular, non-replicated work of art that belongs exclusively to you.</p>",
