          "settings": {
            "icon_image": "shopify://shop_images/Group_1000013458.png",
            "title": "The Golden Window: 6–9 Months",
            "text": "<p>This is the ideal window for the full Julie Sufi experience. It allows for a relaxed evolution of the design dialogue, the sourcing of rare textiles from European mills, and the critical Toile mock-up fitting phase. This timeline ensures that the journey of creating your bespoke wedding gown is as seamless as the final garment.<br/><br/></p>"
