          "settings": {
            "icon_image": "shopify://shop_images/Group_1000013457.png",
            "title": "Short-Lead Commissions",
            "text": "<p>Depending on our atelier capacity and the structural complexity of your vision, we can occasionally facilitate short-lead requests. These are assessed on a case-by-case basis to ensure our commitment to quality is never diluted by the calendar. <br/><br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
