            "description": "<p>Designed for the bride seeking minimalist elegance and architectural purity. This tier focuses on superior fabric choice (such as heavy-weight crepes or Italian Mikado) and our signature internal construction, featuring clean lines and a flawlessly sculpted silhouette.</p>",
