            "heading": "Julie Sufi High Couture Price Range",
            "price": "Starting from AU$8,000",
            "description": "<p>Designed for the bride seeking intricate complexity. This tier includes couture bridal dresses featuring intensive hand-detailing, multi-layered French laces, elaborate beadwork, or significant structural elements like expansive detachable overskirts and cathedral-length extensions.</p>",
            "feature_1_heading": "",
